; Projection reference, version 1 (RFC 8610; OP-159 m.3 (q), CR-43). Deterministic CBOR.
; A projection whose artefact is larger than the 8 192-byte header budget is answered with this
; reference instead. GET `fetch` returns the artefact byte-identical, only to an authenticated PEP
; the artefact's aud names; the verifier recomputes the SHA-256 of the bytes, compares it with
; `digest` and verifies the artefact in full. An offline PAP is never carried by reference.

projection-ref = {
  digest: bstr .size 32,
  size: 8193..16777216,
  fetch: tstr .regexp "/access/v1/domains/[A-Za-z0-9_-]{43}/projections/[A-Za-z0-9_-]{43}",
}
